Unless you have a scroll or wand of teleportation to teleport yourself
out of there, your best bet is to do now what the guard tells you to do
and follow him, he'll show you the way out. The gold is not worth
getting killed by the guard.
Later, when you have found a pick-axe or a wand of digging, you can come
back and dig your way to the gold and pick it up. You can also teleport
in and out, if you have the means for controlled teleportation. Or, if
you get polymorphed to some creature that can walk through the rock
walls (like a xorn), you can use that to your advantage.
(And I probably forgot to mention some other way to reach that gold
later.)

> However, as you've found out, spending too much time in a vault will
> summon a vault guard, which are reasonably strong enemies.

